  "releaseNotes": "Adds bulk energy orders for up to 10 000 addresses (BulkCalculateAsync, BulkCreateAsync, BulkCheckAsync, GetBulkHistoryAsync, BulkReportAsync) and VerifyWebhookSignature. TronzapApiException keeps the result sent with an error and the Retry-After delay; codes 92 and 94 arrive as TronzapBulkPriceChangedException and TronzapBulkNoValidItemsException. ITronzapClient gained the new methods, so custom implementations of the interface must add them. See https://github.com/tron-energy-market/tronzap-sdk-csharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
